# Auth trust root: the bundled staging OIDC fixture holds the token-signing private key.
# CI generates one to run tests in the same checkout that builds this image, so without
# this entry `COPY ops/staging` would bake an ephemeral per-build key into the image and
# silently invalidate every token on each deploy. Deployments inject it at runtime via
# ASTRANULL_BUNDLED_STAGING_OIDC_FIXTURE_JSON instead.
ops/staging/bundled-oidc-fixture.json
